{
  "id": "1CH.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Kigana Kwoŋ Kerin 12",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji ma joluwo Daudi con wok i nono pa Benyamin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a ji ma jobino bongi Daudi i Ziklag, munyo oyido go kinyal woth paka mito kwoŋbedo Saulo wod pa Kisi. Jobedo acele cele kwoŋ jolweny matek ma jokonyo go i lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido jonyalo celo aserin kosa dwiro telin gi cingi gin maracuc kosa maracam, aka oyido jobedo jonono pa Benyamin, wade pa Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jatel oyido obedo Ahiyeza, Yowas, joje wot Sema ma wok Gibeya. Yehiel kodi Pelet wot Azimaveth, Beraka, Yehu ma wok Anathoth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isimaya ma wok Gibeon, jalweny matek kwoŋ cwo piero adek aka jatel pajo; Yeremia, Yahaziel, Yowanan, kodi Yozabad ma wok Gedera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eluzay, Yerimoth, Belia, Semaria, kodi Sefatiya ma wok Harif. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elikana, Isia, Azarel, Yoezer, kodi Yasobeyam ma jo wok Kora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowela kodi Zebadia, wot Yeroham ma wok Gedor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji ma joluwo Daudi wok i nono pa Gad",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a nyingi jolweny matek wok i nono pa Gad ma joriwere gi jolweny pa Daudi munyo go nitie i thim. Oyido joŋeyo swa oro kwote kodi abor, joger paka simbwore, aka jodwir paka amudhe ma got. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jatel obedo Ezer, Obadia obedo mar'ario, Eliab mar'adek, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misimana mar'aŋwen, Yeremia mar'abic, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atay mar'aucel, Eliel mar'abirio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowanan mar'aboro, Elizabad mar'abuŋwen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia mar'apar kodi Makibanay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwo megi wok i nono pa Benyamin oyido jobedo jotel ma cwo gana, kodi cwo miya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a cwo ma joŋado malawa Yordan munyo pi mol i thenge mere i dwe marapena, to jokedho ji m'oyido jobedo i milelo yuwok ceŋ kodi yupodho ceŋ ma malawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji ma joluwo Daudi wok i nono pa Benyamin kodi Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonono pa Benyamin megi kodi jonono pa Yuda jobino bongi Daudi kama go oyido opond'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi okadho romo gi jo aka owaco rijo ni, “Ka wibino paka merin konyan, afoyo gi neno win. Riwere win gi wan! To ka wimito camo ran sereko ri jokwor paran, makada nende akitemo timo riwin raco, Were pa kwarere mawan laŋeyo to miyo win gir'acula.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo cuny pa Were obino kwoŋ Amasay, jatel pa cwo piero adek, aka owaco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji ma joluwo Daudi wok i nono pa Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolweny megi wok i nono pa Manase joriwere gi Daudi munyo obino gi Jofilistia lweny gi Saulo. Kucel go k'okonyo Jofilistia, kole kerin pajo jolworo nike Daudi oyido nyalo camo rijo sereko ri jadwoŋ pere Saulo, ameno jodhiro dok i Ziklag. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a jolweny ma nono pa Manase ma joriwere gi Daudi munyo odwoko: Adina, Yozabad, Yediael, Mikaili, Yozabad, Elihu kodi Zilethay. Jomituka ma kitipin ma cwo gana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotiyo ri Daudi paka jomituka pa jolweny pere kwoŋbedo oyido jobedo jolweny matek. Rumacen jobedo jomituka pa jolweny pa Joisiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole kisi ndelo cwo manyen joriwere gi jolweny pa Daudi, cuka jolweny pere jolokere madwoŋ, paka jolweny pa Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Welo jolweny pa Daudi i Hebron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a welo ma kitipin pa jolweny ma jobino bongi Daudi i Hebron wiro ker pa Saulo wobedi apa Daudi, cungo kwoŋ wac pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Yuda, cwo m'otiek jo aka ma jonitie gi kwote kodi abor obedo 6,800. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Simeo obedo cwo 7,100 m'otiek jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Levi obedo cwo 4,600. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada, nyakwar Aron, kodi cwo 3,700. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zadok, jayac ma jalweny, kodi jomituka piero ario g'ario ma jobedo wade pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Benyamin, nono pa Saulo obedo cwo 3,000. Jonono pa Benyamin madit mere jomedo woro Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Efrayim obedo cwo 20,800 jolweny matek aka ma joŋeyere i pecin pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono ma yupodho ceŋ ma Manase obedo cwo 18,000 m'oyer kadho ketho Daudi kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Isakar, obedo jotel 200 kanyacel gi cwo m'oyido jotelo. Cwo me oyido joŋeyo gima Isiraili ripo timo kodi sawa maber wotim'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Zebulun obedo cwo 50,000 ma joŋeyo oro kisi gilweny aka joyikere konyo Daudi gi atoŋa acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Nafital obedo jotel 1,000 kanyacel gi cwo 37,000 ma jonitie gi kwote kodi abor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Dan cwo 28,600 m'otiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Asiha cwo 40,000 ma joyikere lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonin ma yuwok ceŋ ma Yordan; nono pa Ruben, Gad kodi yuwok ceŋ ma Manase obedo cwo 120,000 ma joŋeyo oro kisi gilweny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolweny me je, ma joyikere lweny, jokadho i Hebron, gi kinen ma ketho Daudi kere ma Isiraili. Joisiraili ma jodoŋ je oyido joriwere gi atoŋa acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobedo kenyo gi Daudi ma ndelo adek, munyo jocemo aka jomedho, kole Joisiraili megi oyido jotedo rijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka joger pajo bende, wok bor cako i nono pa Isakar, Zebulun kodi Nafital, ji jokelo punde, ŋamia, dhok kodi rombo ma jotiŋo cemo, moko, nyandere m'othwo, vini kodi mo. Me je oyido nyutho siemirok m'oyido nitie i Isiraili gipi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
